    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoosiyaah Oo Cusboonaysiiyey Axdiga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa boqorkii cid diray, oo waxaa loo soo ururiyey odayaashii dalka Yahuudah iyo kuwii Yeruusaalem oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo boqorkiina wuxuu u kacay gurigii Rabbiga, oo waxaa isagii la socday raggii dalka Yahuudah oo dhan, iyo dadkii Yeruusaalem degganaa oo dhan, iyo wadaaddadii, iyo nebiyadii, iyo dadkii oo dhan yar iyo weynba; oo isna wuxuu hortooda ku akhriyey dhammaan erayadii kitaabkii axdiga oo gurigii Rabbiga laga dhex helay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa boqorkii istaagay tiirka agtiisii, oo wuxuu Rabbiga hortiisa axdi ugu maray inuu Rabbiga raaco oo uu qalbigiisa oo dhan iyo naftiisa oo dhan ku dhawro amarradiisa, iyo markhaatiyadiisa, iyo qaynuunnadiisa, iyo inuu sii adkeeyo erayadii axdigan oo kitaabkan ku qornaa, oo dadkii oo dhammuna axdigii bay aqbaleen oo u istaageen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa boqorkii ku amray wadaadkii sare oo ahaa Xilqiyaah, iyo wadaaddadii lahaa derejada labaad, iyo iridjoogayaashii, inay macbudka Rabbiga ka soo bixiyaan kulli weelashii loo sameeyey Bacal, iyo geedihii Asheeraah, iyo ciidanka samada oo dhan; oo isna wuxuu ku gubay Yeruusaalem dibaddeeda oo ah berrimmadii Qidroon, oo dambaskoodiina Beytel buu u qaaday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu casilay wadaaddadii sanamyada caabudi jiray oo ay boqorradii dalka Yahuudah u doorteen inay foox ku shidaan meelaha sarsare oo ku yaal magaalooyinka dalka Yahuudah iyo meelaha ku wareegsan Yeruusaalem, iyo weliba kuwii fooxa u shidi jiray Bacal, iyo qorraxda, iyo dayaxa, iyo xiddigaha, iyo ciidanka samada oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo geedihii Asheeraahna gurigii Rabbiga wuu ka soo bixiyey oo wuxuu geeyey Yeruusaalem dibaddeeda ilaa durdurka Qidroon, oo wuxuu ku gubay durdurkii Qidroon agtiisa, oo intuu ku tuntay ayuu budo ka dhigay, oo budadiina ku daadshay qabuurihii dadka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu dumiyey guryihii makhnuudyada oo ku dhex yiil guriga Rabbiga meeshay naaguhu ku samayn jireen daahyadii geedihii Asheeraah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wadaaddadii oo dhanna wuxuu ka soo kaxeeyey magaalooyinkii dalka Yahuudah, wuuna nijaaseeyey meelihii sarsare oo wadaaddadu fooxa ku shidi jireen, tan iyo Gebac ilaa Bi'ir Shebac; oo haddana wuxuu dumiyey meelihii sarsare oo irdaha, kuwaas oo ku yiil meesha laga soo galo iridda Yashuuca oo ahaa taliyihii magaalada, oo ku yiil xagga bidix ee iridda magaalada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habase yeeshee wadaaddadii meelaha sarsare ma ay iman meeshii allabariga oo Rabbiga ee Yeruusaalem ku tiil, laakiinse walaalahood way ku dhex cuni jireen kibis aan khamiir lahayn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu nijaaseeyey Tofed oo ku taal dooxadii reer Xinnom, si uusan ninna wiilkiisa ama gabadhiisa dabkii u dhex marin Moleg. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu fogeeyey fardihii boqorradii dalka Yahuudah ay qorraxda ku siiyeen iridda laga soo galo guriga Rabbiga ee u dhow qolkii Naataan Meleg oo bohon ahaa uu degganaa, oo gaadhifardoodkii qorraxdana buu gubay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo meelihii allabariga oo ku yiil qowladda sare ee Aaxaas saqafkeeda oo boqorradii dalka Yahuudah ay sameeyeen, iyo meelihii allabariga oo Manaseh ka sameeyey labada barxadood oo guriga Rabbiga ayuu boqorkii wada dumiyey, oo halkaas intuu ka orday ayuu boodhkoodii ku shubay durdurkii Qidroon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo boqorkii wuxuu kaloo nijaaseeyey meelihii sarsare oo Yeruusaalem horteeda ku yiil, kuwaas oo ku yiil midigta buurta baabba'a, kuwaas oo Sulaymaan oo ahaa boqorkii reer binu Israa'iil uu u dhisay Cashtored oo ahayd karaahiyadii reer Siidoon, iyo Kemoosh oo ahaa karaahiyadii reer Moo'aab, iyo Milkom oo ahaa karaahiyadii reer Cammoon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu burburiyey tiirarkii, geedihii Asheeraahna wuu jaray, oo meelahoodiina wuxuu ka buuxiyey dad lafahood. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba wuxuu kaloo dumiyey meeshii allabariga ee Beytel ku tiil, iyo meeshii sare oo Yaaraabcaam ina Nebaad oo dadkii Israa'iil dembaajiyey uu sameeyey, oo isla meeshii sare wuu gubay oo intuu ku tuntay ayuu budo ka dhigay, oo geedihii Asheeraahna wuu gubay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Yoosiyaah markuu soo jeestay ayuu arkay qabuurihii buurta ku yiil, oo intuu cid diray oo qabuurihii lafihii ka soo bixiyey ayuu meeshii allabariga ku dul gubay, wuuna nijaaseeyey, sidii uu ahaa erayga Rabbiga oo ninkii Ilaah naadiyey, kaasoo ahaa kii waxyaalahan naadiyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu yidhi, Taalladaas aan arkaa waa maxay? Oo dadkii magaaladu waxay ku yidhaahdeen, Waa qabrigii ninkii Ilaah oo dalka Yahuudah ka yimid oo naadiyey waxyaalahan aad ku samaysay meeshii allabariga ee Beytel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu yidhi, Iska daaya oo yaan ninna lafihiisa dhaqaajin. Sidaas daraaddeed way iska daayeen lafihiisii iyo lafihii nebigii Samaariya ka yimid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo guryihii meelaha sarsare oo dhan ee ku yiil magaalooyinka Samaariya ee ay boqorradii dalka Israa'iil u dhiseen inay Rabbiga kaga xanaajiyaan ayuu Yoosiyaah wada dumiyey, oo wuxuu ku sameeyey falimihii uu Beytel ku sameeyey oo kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wadaaddadii meelaha sarsare oo halkaas joogay oo dhanna wuxuu ku wada laayay meelihii allabariga dushooda, dushoodiina wuxuu ku gubay lafo dad, dabadeedna Yeruusaalem buu ku noqday.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa boqorkii dadkii oo dhan amray oo ku yidhi, Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah u dhawra Iidda Kormaridda, siday ugu qoran tahay kitaabkan axdiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hubaal Iiddaas Kormaridda oo kale lama dhawrin tan iyo wakhtiyadii xaakinnadu reer binu Israa'iil xukumi jireen, iyo wakhtiyadii boqorradii dalka Israa'iil oo dhan, iyo wakhtiyadii boqorradii dalka Yahuudah toona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse sannaddii siddeed iyo tobnaad oo Boqor Yoosiyaah ayaa Iiddaas Kormaridda Rabbiga loogu dhawray Yeruusaalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba Yoosiyaah wuxuu baabbi'iyey kuwii ruuxaanta lahaa, iyo saaxiriintii, iyo teraafiimtii, iyo sanamyadii, iyo dhammaan karaahiyadii lagu arkay dalka Yahuudah iyo Yeruusaalemba, si uu u adkeeyo erayadii sharcigii ku qornaa kitaabkii wadaadkii Xilqiyaah ka dhex helay gurigii Rabbiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isaga hortiis ma jirin boqor la mid ah oo Rabbiga ugu soo jeestay qalbigiisa oo dhan iyo naftiisa oo dhan iyo xooggiisa oo dhan siduu ahaa sharcigii Muuse oo dhan, oo isagii dabadiisna ma uu kicin boqor la mid ahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse Rabbigu kama uu soo noqon cadhadiisii kululayd ee weynayd oo uu dadka Yahuudah ugu cadhooday xanaaqii uu Manaseh isaga ka xanaajiyey aawadiis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Rabbigu yidhi, Anigu dadkii Yahuudahna hortayda waan ka fogaynayaa, sidaan dadkii Israa'iilba u fogeeyey oo kale, oo waan duminayaa magaaladan aan doortay oo ah Yeruusaalem, iyo gurigii aan idhi, Magacaygu halkaas ha yaallo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba Yoosiyaah falimihiisii kale iyo wixii uu sameeyey oo dhammu sow kuma qorna kitaabkii taariikhda boqorradii dalka Yahuudah? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isaga wakhtigiisii ayaa Fircoon Nekoo oo boqorka Masar ahaa ku kacay boqorkii Ashuur ilaa Webi Yufraad, oo waxaa isagii ku soo baxay Boqor Yoosiyaah, markaasaa Fircoon Nekoo isagii ku dilay Megiddoo agteeda markuu arkay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo addoommadiisii intay gaadhifaras Megiddoo kaga qaadeen isagoo meyd ah ayay Yeruusaalem keeneen oo qabrigiisii ku aaseen. Markaasay dadkii waddanku soo wateen Yehoo'aaxaas ina Yoosiyaah, oo intay subkeen ayay boqor uga dhigeen meeshii aabbihiis.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoo'aaxaas, Boqorkii Yahuudah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Yehoo'aaxaas markuu boqor noqday wuxuu jiray saddex iyo labaatan sannadood, oo intii saddex bilood ah ayuu Yeruusaalem boqor ka ahaa; oo hooyadiis magaceeduna wuxuu ahaa Xamuutal ina Yeremyaah, oo reer Libnaah ahayd. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isna wuxuu sameeyey wax Rabbiga hortiisa shar ku ah sidii wixii ay awowayaashiis sameeyeen oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fircoon Nekoo ayaa isagii ku xidhay Riblaah oo ku taal dalka Xamaad si uusan Yeruusaalem boqor ugu sii ahaan; oo dalkiina wuxuu saaray baad ah boqol talanti oo lacag ah iyo talanti dahab ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Fircoon Nekoo ayaa Eliyaaqiim ina Yoosiyaah boqor uga dhigay meeshii aabbihiis Yoosiyaah, oo magiciisiina wuxuu u beddelay Yehooyaaqiim, laakiinse isagu Yehoo'aaxaas buu kaxeeyey, oo markuu Masar keenay ayuu halkaas ku dhintay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Yehooyaaqiim lacagtii iyo dahabkii Fircoon siiyey; laakiinse wuxuu cashuuray dalka inuu lacagtii u bixiyo sidii Fircoon ugu amray; oo lacagtii iyo dahabkii wuxuu ka soo guray dadkii dalka degganaa, intii mid kastaba cashuurtiisu ahayd, si uu Fircoon Nekoo u siiyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
